# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS / Swift / Xcode .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

## Xcode user-specific & build artifacts
build/
dist/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
xcuserdata/
*.moved-aside

## Xcode project (generated by XcodeGen — regenerate with `xcodegen generate`)
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
!default.xcworkspace
*.playground

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Packages/
Package.resolved

## CocoaPods (if ever used)
Pods/

## Carthage (if ever used)
Carthage/Build/

## fastlane (if ever used)
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

## Provisioning / signing
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile

## GCP 서비스 계정 키 — 절대 커밋 금지(Drive 자동 업로드용 자격증명)
*-service-account*.json
gcp-*.json
secrets/

## Drive 업로드 스크립트 전용 파이썬 가상환경
scripts/.venv/

## Misc
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.env
.env.local

## MCP 도구가 남기는 디버그 산출물
.playwright-mcp/
